public abstract class WindowCounter implements MetricCounter, Runnable {  

    private final LongAdder totalCountAdder = new LongAdder();  

    private final LongAdder intervalCountAdder = new LongAdder();  

    private final MetricBean metricBean;  

    @Override  
    public MetricBean receiveMetricBean() {  
        return this.metricBean;  
    }  

    public WindowCounter(MetricBean metricBean, Integer duration, TimeUnit timeUnit, Scheduler scheduler) {  
        this.metricBean = metricBean;  
        scheduler.schedulePeriodically(this, duration, duration, timeUnit);  
        scheduler.start();  
    }  

    @Override  
    public void clear() {  
        totalCountAdder.reset();  
        intervalCountAdder.reset();  
    }  

    public void run() {  
        intervalCountAdder.reset();  
    }  

    @Override  
    public long fetchCounter() {  
        return this.totalCountAdder.sum();  
    }  

    public long retrieveAllCount() {  
        return this.totalCountAdder.sum();  
    }  

    @Override  
    public void increase() {  
        totalCountAdder.increment();  
        callMeter(totalCountAdder.sum());  
    }  

    @Override  
    public void reduce() {  
        throw new UnsupportedOperationException("WindowCounter not support reduce");  
    }  

    public long obtainWindowCount() {  
        return intervalCountAdder.sum();  
    }  

}

